  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The maximum acceleration of an object that oscillates with simple harmonic motion (SHM) is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span>. The distance between the two maximum displacement positions of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span> m. What is the magnitude of the object's velocity when it is halfway between the maximum displacement and the equilibrium positions?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{150}\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{300}\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{600}\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{1200}\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
